Description: record the TACACS+ session mapping for nss_tacplus
 After authorization, call libtacplus-map's update_mapuser() with the
 priv-lvl the server returned, and clear the record at session close
 (__update_loguid), as the Cumulus and VyOS forks of pam_tacplus do.
 nss_tacplus maps a TACACS+ user to the local account tacacsN only through
 this record: without it a TACACS+ login gets none of tacacsN's groups and
 its uid never maps back to the TACACS+ name. test/map_test.sh checks that
 the module is linked with libtacplus_map and calls both entry points.
Author: NuDanOS Maintainers <jon@fernandez.tech>
Forwarded: not-needed

